    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u>Strange rumors are spreading across the kingdom.</u></h2><br>The kingdom of Iron Crown is in chaos. Its once peaceful and complacent inhabitants are on the brink of a civil war that threatens to destroy peace. After years of questionable decisions by the ruler, one last rumor is all that is needed to cut the tension: The king is long dead.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3080430/extras/9443d9806755ccb0c2b6dcd91d43297d.avif?t=1747351131\" width=620 height=348 /></span><br><br>Play as a kind and quiet wolf who, when faced with this rumor, decides to embark on a journey to find out if the rumor is true\u2026 or not. Luckily, you won't be alone: a cast of charismatic characters will help you on your adventure and watch over your safety to prevent you from doing something crazy and dying in the attempt. But it won't all be pleasant\u2026<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>Howdy! Do you see something handy, my boy?</i></h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3080430/extras/607f3d0bac327603c46f6d99329fa63c.avif?t=1747351131\" width=320 height=291 /></span><br>Crowley, peddler (and charlatan).<br><br><br>Iron Crown mixes deck-building and tactics games with the roguelike genre, bringing together a unique fusion to create a challenge that is not just about defeating the enemy with brute force, but where strategy plays an important role.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3080430/extras/48ea2dc6c41bbc251af7a5c916f1798e.poster.avif?t=1747351131\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3080430/extras/48ea2dc6c41bbc251af7a5c916f1798e.webm?t=1747351131\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3080430/extras/48ea2dc6c41bbc251af7a5c916f1798e.mp4?t=1747351131\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Place your cards in the order you want them executed and progress to complete the scenario. As you progress, you will unlock upgrades to facilitate your next expedition towards the truth!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3080430/extras/8dfd78ca03743a6146d0f47cf576c168.avif?t=1747351131\" width=734 height=348 /></span><br><br>Because the king is alive\u2026 isn\u2019t he?",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u>Strange rumors are spreading across the kingdom.</u></h2><br>The kingdom of Iron Crown is in chaos. Its once peaceful and complacent inhabitants are on the brink of a civil war that threatens to destroy peace. After years of questionable decisions by the ruler, one last rumor is all that is needed to cut the tension: The king is long dead.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3080430/extras/9443d9806755ccb0c2b6dcd91d43297d.avif?t=1747351131\" width=620 height=348 /></span><br><br>Play as a kind and quiet wolf who, when faced with this rumor, decides to embark on a journey to find out if the rumor is true\u2026 or not. Luckily, you won't be alone: a cast of charismatic characters will help you on your adventure and watch over your safety to prevent you from doing something crazy and dying in the attempt. But it won't all be pleasant\u2026<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>Howdy! Do you see something handy, my boy?</i></h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3080430/extras/607f3d0bac327603c46f6d99329fa63c.avif?t=1747351131\" width=320 height=291 /></span><br>Crowley, peddler (and charlatan).<br><br><br>Iron Crown mixes deck-building and tactics games with the roguelike genre, bringing together a unique fusion to create a challenge that is not just about defeating the enemy with brute force, but where strategy plays an important role.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3080430/extras/48ea2dc6c41bbc251af7a5c916f1798e.poster.avif?t=1747351131\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3080430/extras/48ea2dc6c41bbc251af7a5c916f1798e.webm?t=1747351131\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3080430/extras/48ea2dc6c41bbc251af7a5c916f1798e.mp4?t=1747351131\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Place your cards in the order you want them executed and progress to complete the scenario. As you progress, you will unlock upgrades to facilitate your next expedition towards the truth!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3080430/extras/8dfd78ca03743a6146d0f47cf576c168.avif?t=1747351131\" width=734 height=348 /></span><br><br>Because the king is alive\u2026 isn\u2019t he?",
